that fail write the same refusal frame under 255 with ex
exec
/bin/zsh -lc "ssh -n hbox 'cat /tank/dregg-build/nanodregg/logs/DOCS-AUDIT-records-002.txt'" in /Users/ember/dev/redregg/work/codex/DOCS-AUDIT
 succeeded in 202ms:
it 2 (`main`, `:9144-9160`).

