`:269-308`): content 1, eventHistory 2, authority 3, declaredObject 5, resourceBook 6, accountMetadata 8,
declaredProgram 9, policySource 10, pay 11, stream 12, nockProgram 13, clock 14, streamEntry 15, system 16,
