1: //! The residents frames, as their two consumers read them (HOSTING-26, HOSTING-30): keybroker and
2: //! nd-members each ask their Lean decider which resident grains the World holds, and each reads the
3: //! decider's end, with this one code (CLIENT-29: one consumer shape, never a second parser).
4: 
